     1531   field cash-num      as integer
     1532   field cash-num-char as character
     1533   field port-num      as character
     1534   field way           as character
     1535   field is-script     as logical
     1536   field pswd          as character
     1537   field waiting-sek   as integer
     1538   field other-info    as character
     1539   field order-num     as integer
     1540   field secondary     as integer
     1541   field shift-fields  as integer
     1542   field binary        as logical
