     2503                                             , input "":U).
     2504       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "TCCode"
     2505                                             , input string(cash-txr.rate-code), input 1 ).
     2506       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "TCType"
