     2508       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "TCValue"
     2509                                             , input string(if cash-txr.rate-value = ?
     2510                                                            then 0
     2511                                                            else cash-txr.rate-value), input 1 ).
     2512       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "TCInclude"
     2513                                             , input string(1), input 1 ).
     2514       run bgelib-tag-put in this-procedure ( input 4, input "TCLock"
